Q4. Reverse a String (Without Using [::-1])

Write a function reverse_string(text) that reverses a string using a loop.

Example:

Input: Python

Output: nohtyP
 SOLUTION
text = (input(" enter your string "))
def reverse_string(text):
    reverse =""
    for i  in range (len(text) -1,-1,-1):
     reverse = reverse + text[i]
       
    return reverse

print(reverse_string(text))
